cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AreaGIS Kit in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "AreaGIS Kit: one-click geospatial studies for QGIS and ArcGIS Pro"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kaushik
    given-names: Pradeepika
version: 0.14.1
date-released: 2026-11-18
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24326879
repository-code: "https://github.com/Praddy-GByte/areagiskit"
url: "https://github.com/Praddy-GByte/areagiskit"
abstract: >-
  AreaGIS Kit runs a complete geospatial study of any area in one run: Flood, LULC, Landslide, Crop, Urban and
  Health. Each kit fetches open data for the area, runs the standard analyses for its field, compares its results
  with independent data where it can, grades its confidence and writes a Word, PDF and HTML report that states
  what the results cannot tell you.
keywords:
  - QGIS
  - ArcGIS Pro
  - GIS
  - remote sensing
  - Sentinel-1
  - Sentinel-2
  - flood mapping
  - landslide susceptibility
  - land use land cover
  - agriculture
  - urban heat island
  - spatial epidemiology
